{
  "bodyHash": "z+hRs1UwUL0=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/30b62acab7a3933953e7f112b7ea0019a0ffd6b9.png\" width=\"711\" height=\"261\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cf801a8621ad1dfafb9b3c752f15b67273b63b65.webp\" width=\"554\" height=\"43\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>注意：僅版本 1.20.1 及以上會持續更新。</strong></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#800080\">關於</span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此模組作為<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crackers-wither-storm-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cracker's Wither Storm Mod</a> 的附加元件，並加入了專屬原聲帶，以藝術家 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Vertigo_Music/featured\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vertigo</a> 創作的客製化曲目取代模組預設音樂。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>重要注意事項：與 CWSM 的預設音樂相同，本模組新增的所有曲目音量可透過選單中 <em>「選項 > 音樂與音效」</em> 的 <em>「唱片機/音階盒」</em> 滑桿進行調整。</strong></span><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:8px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#936\">設定檔資料夾：</span> <span style=\"font-size:18px\">config/CWSM V-Sides; Common.toml</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可設定的項目：</span></span></strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000\">切換模組中任何曲目是否播放（包含停用整個原聲帶的選項）</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000\">音樂字幕是否預設啟用</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000\">凋零風暴是否掉落枯萎收音機</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000\">停用每次首次進入世界時顯示的訊息</span></span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#669\">當滿足以下條件時，將會播放專屬音樂（依通常發生順序排列）：</span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><br></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">•&nbsp; 凋零風暴（第 1-3 階段）位於玩家 100 格範圍內，<em>若玩家深入地面 14 格以下則停止播放</em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">•&nbsp; 凋零風暴（第 4-5 階段）位於玩家 230 格範圍內，<em>若玩家深入地面 14 格以下則停止播放</em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">•&nbsp; 枯萎共生體位於玩家 69 格範圍內</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">•&nbsp; 被擊倒的凋零風暴位於玩家 88 格範圍內（以及在復活時）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">•&nbsp; 凋零風暴（第 6-7 階段）位於玩家 350 格範圍內，<em>若玩家深入地面 14 格以下則停止播放</em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">•&nbsp; 玩家位於深處內部</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">•&nbsp; 與指令方塊的戰鬥開始，每個階段有 3 首獨特曲目</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">•&nbsp; 凋零風暴最終從世界中被消滅</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#c9f;text-decoration:underline\">枯萎收音機</span></span></strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#c9f\"><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:14px\">在擊敗凋零風暴後獲得，允許玩家隨意收聽風暴肆虐期間播放的所有曲目，以及未使用/專屬的（版本）曲目，這些曲目在預設生存遊戲中原本無法聽到。</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#c9f\"><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:14px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/GDthJj5eLp0?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#669\">模組中所有曲目列表（依通常播放順序排列）：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/W0yfu0ksVpY?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/umCQV1Vxq1w?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kFI9IPHXQpw?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Zx2O9I7Oo7E?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/uJnF7ZUmQHQ?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/s_sSW9QulE4?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-nNrDxm-Qys?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#669\">模組中包含的其他功能：</span></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">•&nbsp; 根據當前播放的歌曲，玩家動作條上方會短暫顯示訊息，告知目前正在播放的曲目。<strong>玩家也可以輸入指令序列 <em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">/cwsmvsides.enable.subtitles (true/false)</span></em> 來隨意切換此功能！</strong><br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/075adfb35fc91b9de33c5c4f7bd03ba93f9c9951.png\" width=\"539\" height=\"280\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">•&nbsp; 可隨時透過 <strong><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">/cwsmvsides.enable (true/false)</span></em></strong> 切換原聲帶<br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cd2196cb6a65c7fa795f3ace69bdf2eea7ef623c.png\" width=\"389\" height=\"104\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（注意：每次玩家首次進入世界時，會彈出訊息說明此功能。）</span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">「音樂只在 BOSS 生成時播放」</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">你可能安裝了 <strong>Dynamic Surroundings</strong>。別擔心，無需移除該模組。請按照以下步驟即可<strong>在仍安裝 Dynamic Surroundings 的情況下</strong>徹底解決問題。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1T0fpHUYm9zE_luBFx0mNjUFQxZxxc6drXSR_lBbBJCc/edit?usp=sharing\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1T0fpHUYm9zE_luBFx0mNjUFQxZxxc6drXSR_lBbBJCc/edit?usp=sharing</a></span></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
